kind: llman.sdd.spec
name: "retrieval-and-cache"
purpose: 定义共享检索策略与缓存失效模型，覆盖 outputs/slides/qa/refine 等路径的统一检索行为。该规范强调检索上下文一致性与可预测缓存失效，避免跨路径出现“同输入不同上下文”的漂移。
valid_scope[2]: src/,tests/
requirements[16]{req_id,title,statement}:
  r43,Retrieval strategy is shared across generation paths,outputs 与 slides MUST 复用同一检索策略族（预算、去重、多样性、融合）。
  r101,Retrieval context obeys token budget,检索上下文 MUST 受 token budget 约束，超预算时 MUST 截断或压缩。
  r138,"Multi-query retrieval is bounded","启用 multi-query 时 MUST 受 seed 上限、融合策略与去重规则约束。"
  r174,"Epoch-based cache invalidation is canonical",sources/vector 相关缓存 MUST 基于 `sources_epoch` 与 `vector_epoch` 失效。
  r206,Epoch bumps are atomic and monotonic,并发下 epoch 递增 MUST 原子且单调递增。
  r234,Optional retrieval assembly cache is versioned,若启用检索组装缓存，key MUST 包含 epoch 版本信息以避免脏命中。
  r254,Embed strategy converts distance to similarity,"EmbedStrategy MUST 将 sqlite-vec 返回的 distance 转换为 similarity score (score = 1 - distance)。过滤 MUST 使用 score >= minScore，minScore 默认 0.2。topK 默认 8。MUST NOT 直接用 distance 做 >= 比较（方向相反）。"
  r267,Chunking uses 800/100 sliding window,文本分块 MUST 使用 800 字符块大小 + 100 字符重叠的滑动窗口（对齐 v1）。MUST NOT 使用无重叠的段落切分。分块参数 MUST 可配置。
  r276,Context window enforces token budget,"检索上下文组装 MUST 受 token budget 约束，超预算时按优先级截断（history→retrieval→recent→system→query）。token 计数 MUST 使用 gpt-tokenizer（cl100k_base）。MUST NOT 用字符数截断替代 token 截断。"
  r60,"Multi-query expansion with RRF fusion","检索 MUST 支持 multi-query 扩展：按 output_type 生成 query seeds，多查询结果 RRF (k=60) 融合。MUST 受 seed_cap 限制避免无界扩展。"
  r66,EpochCache wired to strategies and source mutations,EpochCache MUST 接线到各策略 retrieve()。源增删改 MUST bump sources_epoch，向量重嵌 MUST bump vector_epoch。缓存 key MUST 包含 epoch 版本。MUST NOT 零调用（死代码）。
  "studio-rag-through-registry",Studio retrieval MUST go through the unified RAG registry,studio 生成检索 MUST 通过统一 ragRegistry.retrieveWith 走 embed/fusion/diversity 路径，MUST NOT 用原始文本 slice 截断（对齐 qa/outputs/refine 的检索路径一致性）
  "qa-retrieval-must-be-deterministic","QA retrieval MUST be deterministic single-embed (no multi-query expansion)","QA 检索 MUST 使用确定性单次 embed 检索路径（与 v1 service.py:319-327 单次 embed_batch + 单次 cached_vector_search 对齐），MUST NOT 在 QA 检索路径硬编码 multiQuery:true（当前 retrieve-and-judge.ts:139 违反此约束，会经 multi-query seed 扩张 + RRF fusion 改变边集与 score 语义）"
  "qa-source-scoping",QA retrieval MUST support source_ids filtering and empty skip,QA 检索路径 MUST 支持通过 source_ids 参数将检索范围限定到指定 source 子集，并支持可配置的 min_score 阈值作为证据门控；当 source_ids 缺失或为空时 MUST 跳过向量检索（不得回退为全库检索）。
  "vector-search-source-filter",Vector search MUST support source_ids filtering,向量检索 MUST 支持通过 source_ids 参数将 KNN 搜索范围限定到指定 source 子集
  "context-must-actually-truncate-when-over-budget",Context assembly MUST actually truncate or compress when over token budget (not just set a flag),"When the assembled retrieval context exceeds the token budget the system MUST actually truncate or compress the context to fit the budget (preserving the highest-priority blocks and partially trimming the boundary block) and MUST NOT merely set a compressed boolean flag while passing the full untruncated context through to the LLM. The truncation MUST follow the v1 _truncate_blocks priority order (history then retrieval then recent then system then query) and use gpt-tokenizer token counting. Current retrieve-and-judge.ts computes compressed=true but never acts on it, leaving the context oversized and risking context-window overflow on large notebooks."
scenarios[18]{req_id,id,given,when,then,feature}:
  r43,"shared-retrieval-across-paths","",outputs 与 slides 路径执行检索,系统 SHALL 复用同一检索策略族（预算/去重/多样性/融合）,true
  r101,"context-truncates-when-over-budget","",组装的检索上下文超过 token budget,系统 SHALL 截断或压缩上下文以满足预算约束,true
  r138,"multi-query-remains-bounded","","启用 multi-query 检索",系统 SHALL 遵守 seed 上限、融合策略与去重规则以保持有界,true
  r174,"epoch-invalidates-stale-cache","",sources 或 vector 发生变更并 bump epoch,系统 SHALL 基于 `sources_epoch`/`vector_epoch` 使相关缓存失效以避免脏命中,true
  r206,"concurrent-epoch-bumps-are-safe","",多个并发请求同时触发 epoch 递增,系统 SHALL 保证递增操作原子且单调递增,true
  r234,"retrieval-assembly-cache-key-is-versioned","",系统启用检索组装缓存并存取 cache,cache key SHALL 包含 epoch 版本信息以避免命中旧上下文,true
  r254,happy,"sqlite-vec 返回 distance=0.3 的 chunk",EmbedStrategy 检索,score=0.7，>= 0.2 通过过滤，按 score desc 排序,true
  r267,happy,5000 字文档入库,分块,产生约 8 个 chunk，每块约 800 字符，相邻块共享 100 字符重叠,true
  r276,happy,检索上下文 5000 token 但预算 4000,组装上下文,按优先级截断至 4000 token 内，system+query 保留,true
  r60,happy,FAQ 类型输出 + 用户查询,"multi-query 扩展","生成 2-3 个 seed query，各检索后 RRF 融合 top 结果",true
  r66,happy,notebook 新增源后检索,EpochCache 查询,sources_epoch 变更，缓存失效，重新检索,true
  "studio-rag-through-registry","generation-retrieves-context",studio 生成需要上下文,检索阶段,系统 SHALL 调用 ragRegistry.retrieveWith 而非直接 join chunks+sources 后 slice,true
  "qa-retrieval-must-be-deterministic","deterministic-retrieval",同一 question + 同一组 source_ids + 同一 embedding,系统执行 QA 检索两次,两次产出 SHALL 完全一致（无 seed 扩张、无 RRF 归一化），且与 v1 单次 embed 路径产出可比,true
  "qa-source-scoping","empty-skips-retrieval",笔记本有多个 source,QA 请求未提供 source_ids 或为空数组,系统 SHALL 不执行向量检索，且不得返回任何检索 hit,true
  "vector-search-source-filter","scoped-knn",notebook 有多个 source 的向量,"searchVectors 传入 sourceIds=[2,3]",系统 SHALL 仅返回 source 2 和 3 的 KNN 结果,true
  "context-must-actually-truncate-when-over-budget","over-budget-truncates",the assembled retrieval context token count exceeds the configured max_tokens budget,the system builds the context for LLM generation,"the context passed to the LLM MUST be truncated to fit the budget (preserving highest-priority blocks and partially trimming the boundary block) and the compressed flag MUST be true",true
  "context-must-actually-truncate-when-over-budget","under-budget-passthrough",the assembled context is within the budget,the system builds the context,no truncation MUST occur and compressed MUST be false and the context MUST pass through unchanged,true
  "context-must-actually-truncate-when-over-budget","priority-order-and-token-counting",the context exceeds budget and must shed tokens,selecting which blocks to drop or trim,"the system MUST follow the v1 priority order (history then retrieval then recent then system then query) and MUST use gpt-tokenizer token counts not character counts",true
